你必须跟你朋友旅游去
You're going on that trip with your friend.

344
00:12:10,980 --> 00:12:11,380
什么
What?

345
00:12:11,700 --> 00:12:13,200
海莉 我爱你
Haley, I love you.

346
00:12:13,540 --> 00:12:14,760
你如果不想在那店里干活
If you don't want to work in that store,

347
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:16,280
我一定帮你找份喜欢的好工作
I'll help you find something you like better.

348
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:18,120
你这是在搞反向心理战术吗
Is this reverse psychiatry?

349
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:20,420
不 宝贝 妈妈不说反话
No, honey. Actually, nothing is.

350
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:22,520
我只是想你开心
I just want you to be happy.

351
00:12:22,820 --> 00:12:24,420
妈 你别吓我啊
Mom, you're freaking me out.

352
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,840
你俩吵吵啥呢
Why is everyone screaming?

353
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,016
-给你 -给你
- Here! - Here!

354
00:12:27,820 --> 00:12:28,880
我是卢克
This is luke.

355
00:12:29,061 --> 00:12:31,120
爸妈怎么这么异常啊
Why are mom and dad acting so cracy?

356
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,200
不知道 这也太吓人了
I don't know, but it's creepy.

357
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:33,560
肯定有什么不对劲
Something's going on.

358
00:12:33,800 --> 00:12:35,540
你觉得这跟妈的心脏病有关吗
Do you think it has to do with mom's heart thing?

359
00:12:35,580 --> 00:12:37,020
搞不好她的病其实比他们说的严重许多
Like it's more serious than they're saying?

360
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:39,260
-我们得去医院 -天呐 天呐
- We have to go to the hospital. - Oh, my god! Oh, my god!

361
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:41,320
好啦二位姐姐 淡定
Okay, everybody, calm down.

362
00:12:42,300 --> 00:12:43,380
现在已知的情况是
Here's what we know.

363
00:12:43,940 --> 00:12:46,560
老妈只是去医院做个小手术
Mom had to go to the hospital for a simple procedure.

364
00:12:46,940 --> 00:12:49,380
然后爸妈都打给我们 并且言行怪异
Then mom and dad start calling us, acting weird.

365
00:12:50,100 --> 00:12:51,120
擦亮双眼吧
Open your eyes, people.

366
00:12:51,660 --> 00:12:52,660
他们是被绑架了
They've been kidnapped.

367
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:59,620
既然都参观完了 我们可以把这衣服脱了吧
Well, now that the tour's over, we can probably take these off.

368
00:13:00,140 --> 00:13:01,200
不着急吧
I don't see the rush.

369
00:13:01,365 --> 00:13:04,180
待会面试 你脑筋一定会转的飞快的
And you gotta be mentally sharp for your interview.

370
00:13:04,180 --> 00:13:04,840
感觉如何
How you feeling?

371
00:13:05,260 --> 00:13:05,780
感觉良好
Pretty good.

372
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:08,000
父母是可以在里面旁听面试的
You know, parents are allowed to sit in,

373
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:08,920
但你要是不想进去
but if you don't feel like it...

374
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:10,680
开什么玩笑 我可不能错过
Are you kidding me? I wouldn't miss it.

375
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:12,140
此刻是一切辉煌的起点
This is where it all starts.

376
00:13:12,740 --> 00:13:14,720
你好像开始喜欢这地方了 杰
Sure seems like you've come around on this place, Jay.

377
00:13:14,820 --> 00:13:16,980
我怎能不喜欢 这地方棒极了
How could I not? This place is unbelievable.

378
00:13:17,529 --> 00:13:19,238
我已经开始想象俱乐部里的那些瘪三
I'm already picturing those jerks at the club

379
00:13:19,238 --> 00:13:21,822
仰慕我儿子穿着帅气的德莱顿校服闪亮登场
seeing my son walk in wearing a dryden jacket.

380
00:13:22,524 --> 00:13:23,705
曼尼·迪尔加多
Manny Delgado?

381
00:13:26,726 --> 00:13:28,608
我想说的是
I-I guess what I'm trying to say is,

382
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,720
我喜欢读书
I like books for reading them.

383
00:13:30,872 --> 00:13:32,100
你能详细说说吗
You care to elaborate?

384
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:32,500
那当然
Indeed.

385
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:39,940
你看过电影里的慢动作镜头吗
Did you ever see one of those slow-motion movies

386
00:13:39,940 --> 00:13:41,720
一座赌场从内而外地爆炸
where they destroy an old casino,

387
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:43,480
火光四射 轰然倒塌
and it just implodes?

388
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:45,860
就是这感觉
That.

389
00:13:46,580 --> 00:13:48,100
你最喜欢的作家是谁
So who are your favorite authors?

390
00:13:48,380 --> 00:13:49,480
可多了
That's a long list.

391
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:52,620
首先是那谁 叫什么来着
I'd probably have to start with...

392
00:13:52,620 --> 00:13:54,960
使劲来一拳试试
Go ahead. Hard as you can.

393
00:14:05,660 --> 00:14:06,500
真好吃
So good.

394
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,840
我想吃芝士汉堡
I want a cheeseburger.

395
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,910
这可是越南的"草"汤
But this is a special soup called pho.

396
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:12,060
你还说不准说脏话呢[操]
You told me not to say that word.

397
00:14:12,460 --> 00:14:16,120
好吃极了 这可是你们民族的美食呢
It is delicious. This is the food of your people.

398
00:14:16,300 --> 00:14:17,340
还需要些什么吗
Can I get you anything else?

399
00:14:17,340 --> 00:14:19,289
其实嘛 我们正在给我们女儿
Actually, um, we're just trying to teach our daughter

400
00:14:19,300 --> 00:14:20,440
介绍你们国家
about your country.

401
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:22,940
我这样说 其实私心希望你是越南来的
And as I'm saying that, I'm hoping you're from Vietnam.

402
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,080
我在那儿出生
I was born there.

403
00:14:24,103 --> 00:14:25,560
莉莉也是
Uh, so was Lily.

404
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:26,700
那是个美丽的国家
Oh. It's a beautiful country.

405
00:14:26,700 --> 00:14:28,660
我家里人还住在那儿
Um, my family still lives there.

406
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:29,680
我恨越南
I hate Vietnam!

407
00:14:29,940 --> 00:14:31,480
莉莉 宝贝 我们不能仇恨
Lily, honey, we don't hate.

408
00:14:31,660 --> 00:14:33,380
我恨越南
I hate Vietnam.

409
00:14:33,763 --> 00:14:37,073
不好意思 我们得教育一下她
Okay, um, we need just a second.

410
00:14:37,380 --> 00:14:38,560
莉莉 这样不礼貌
Lily, that was rude.

411
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:40,100
我想回家
I wanna go home.

412
00:14:40,100 --> 00:14:44,440
不 敬仰自己祖宗的文化是很重要的
No. It's important that you celebrate the culture of your ancestors.

413
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:45,800
你是越南人
You are Vietnamese.

414
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:48,620
我不是 我是同性恋 我是同性恋
No, I'm not. I'm gay! I'm gay!

415
00:14:49,400 --> 00:14:52,040
宝贝 你不是同性恋 你只是困惑而已
Honey, no, you're not gay. You are just confused.

416
00:14:52,140 --> 00:14:53,880
天呐 我这是怎么了 感觉好像...
Oh, my god. What is wrong with me? It's like I...

417
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:56,280
别误会 我们有一堆女同性恋朋友
Oh, please. We have tons of lesbian friends.

418
00:14:56,372 --> 00:14:58,614
你怎么不跟人解释说我们俩也是同性恋
Odd that you would reference our friends and not us.

419
00:14:58,614 --> 00:14:59,400
-我错了错了 -我们也是同性恋哦
- I know. I know. - Also gay.

420
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,100
-我们走吧 -不准走
- We should just go. - No, nobody's going anywhere

421
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:02,680
她把汤喝完了才准走
until she finishes the whole soup!

422
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:03,720
算了歌洛莉亚 没关系
No, Gloria, it's fine.

423
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:05,049
-我们不想逼她 -不行不行 不能算了
- We don't wanna push her. No, no, no, it's not fine.

424
00:15:05,060 --> 00:15:06,660
这就是这个国家的问题所在
That's the problem with this country.

425
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:08,340
大家都不认祖归宗了
Nobody cares where they come from.

426
00:15:08,420 --> 00:15:11,080
大家都只吃芝士汉堡 上预科学校
They just want cheeseburgers and prep school,

427
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:13,420
他们都忘了祖国哥伦比亚
And they have forgotten about Colombia!

428
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:16,140
好吧 我不禁觉得
Okay, I can't help but feel

429
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:17,820
你刚刚说的那些问题
that maybe you're bringing something to the table

430
00:15:17,828 --> 00:15:20,254
好像不全跟莉莉有关
that's possibly, uh, not at all about Lily.

431
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:22,480
你说得对
I think you're right.

432
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:26,880
这感觉就像 万恶的美帝国夺走了我的孩子
It's just that I feel like I'm losing my children to America.

433
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:29,020
他们长大后
They're just going to grow up

434
00:15:29,020 --> 00:15:31,460
都会变成无聊的白人老头儿
and become boring old white people.

435
00:15:32,088 --> 00:15:34,701
别误会 我们大部分朋友都是白人
Uh, most of our friends are white, actually.

436
00:15:35,522 --> 00:15:36,940
好吧 大家都冷静点儿
Uh... Okay, can everybody just calm down

437
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:38,200
大家都该干嘛干嘛去吧
and go back to their own conversations?

438
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,459
谢谢啦
Just... Thank you.

439
00:15:39,967 --> 00:15:42,454
嘿 你怎么了
Hey. Hey, what's going on with you?

440
00:15:43,300 --> 00:15:45,860
曼尼都快把西班牙语忘光了
Manny has forgotten most of his Spanish,

441
00:15:45,860 --> 00:15:48,320
而乔甚至根本不会去学
And Joe--I'm sure he's not even going to learn it.

442
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:50,980
我知道这很傻 但我就是不喜欢
I know this is silly, but I just don't like

443
00:15:50,980 --> 00:15:54,360
自己跟家里的其他人完全不同
feeling like I'm so different from the rest of my family.

444
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:55,460
噢 小可怜
Oh, honey.

445
00:15:55,460 --> 00:15:57,908
-太孤独了 -慢着
- It feels so lonely, yes. - Oh, wait just a second.

446
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:59,840
莉莉 你是因为这个才想做同性恋的吗
Lily, is that why you want to be gay,

447
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,322
这样更像大爸二爸吗
to be more like your daddies?

448
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:04,080
宝贝 不 就算我们三个来自不同的地方
Oh, honey. No, the three of us are a family

449
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,720
我们依然是一家人
even though we come from different places.

450
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:07,440
你出生在越南
You know, you were born in vietnam,

451
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,940
我在城市长大
and I grew up in a city,

452
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:10,320
尽管你大爸没说过
and even though he never talks about it,

453
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,560
其实他是在农场长大的
your daddy grew up on a farm.

454
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:12,284
是的
Yeah.

455
00:16:12,284 --> 00:16:13,860
重点是 我们是一家人
The point is, is that we're a family

456
00:16:13,860 --> 00:16:15,280
是因为我们彼此深爱着
because we love each other.

457
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,880
-知道了 -你知道吗
- Okay. - And you know what?

458
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:19,586
你刚刚在餐厅引发了一场闹剧
You just caused a scene in a restaurant...

459
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:22,180
这是最像你大爸二爸的地方
and you can't get any more like your daddies than that.

460
00:16:22,940 --> 00:16:25,280
也许这个暑假
Maybe I'll just take Manny and Joe

461
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:26,520
我应该带曼尼和乔去哥伦比亚
to Colombia this summer.

462
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:27,840
我觉得这是个好主意
I think that's a great idea.

463
00:16:28,160 --> 00:16:30,260
我真心觉得经常接触自己的根源
I really think that keeping in touch with your heritage

464
00:16:30,260 --> 00:16:31,880
只会丰富我们的文化
only enriches our culture.

465
00:16:32,740 --> 00:16:34,920
绝对的 我觉得如果大家都是从哪儿来
Absolutely. I think we would all be better off

466
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:37,340
回哪儿去 我们的日子会好过很多
if people would go back to where they came from.

467
00:16:41,280 --> 00:16:41,720
我
I...

468
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:43,220
-我把车开过来 -好的
- I'll pull the car around. - Yes.

469
00:16:46,580 --> 00:16:49,600
我能想到的全是和妈妈在一起的美好时光
All I can think about are the good times I had with mom.

470
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:51,369
到时候谁来陪我走红毯
Who's gonna walk me down the aisle?

471
00:16:51,380 --> 00:16:52,200
别瞎想了
Stop spinning out.

472
00:16:52,300 --> 00:16:54,340
想象这些恐怖的未来没什么意义
There's no point in imagining some horrible future.

473
00:17:03,820 --> 00:17:07,260
亲爱的
Hey, buddy.

474
00:17:08,020 --> 00:17:09,080
你成功了
You made it.

475
00:17:09,540 --> 00:17:10,520
你在天堂
You're in heaven.

476
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:12,175
-不好笑 -好吧
- That's not funny. - Okay.

477
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:12,840
咚咚咚
Knock, knock.

478
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,500
算了吧 她没心情开玩笑
Don't bother. She's not in the mood for jokes.

479
00:17:14,500 --> 00:17:15,800
检测结果很好
Your results are great.

480
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:17,600
血小板是最低值 你的心脏很健康
Minimal plaque. Your heart is strong.

481
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:19,940
谢谢 真是好消息
Thank you. That's such good news.

482
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:21,560
继续吃药
Well, keep taking your medication,

483
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:23,540
-你会活得比我们都长 -谢谢
- you'll outlive all of us. - Thanks.

484
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:24,820
亲爱的 你挺过来了
Honey, you nailed it.

485
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:27,040
你没有担心 对吗
You weren't worried, were you?

486
00:17:27,700 --> 00:17:28,160
没
No.

487
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:29,540
我也没担心
Me, neither.

488
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,120
我还没抱够
I wasn't done with that.

489
00:17:32,180 --> 00:17:32,800
我也是
Me, neither.

490
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:38,620
老天 你的头发在香烟里泡过吗
God, do you soak your hair in cigarettes?

491
00:17:39,060 --> 00:17:40,720
你的衣服是用眼泪洗得吗
Do you wash your clothes in tears?

492
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:42,660
我得回家了 室友需要这双鞋子
I have to get home. My roommate needs these shoes.

493
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:45,000
怪胎
Weirdos.

494
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:47,640
卢克 别这么刻薄 我今天无法承受
Luke, don't be so mean. I can't take it today.

495
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:49,160
可能我现在就要姐兼母职了
I may be your sort of mom now...

496
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,820
我自己都还是个孩子
and I'm practically a child myself.

497
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:52,600
好了 大家冷静
Okay, let's calm down.

498
00:17:52,980 --> 00:17:53,700
妈可能没事
Mom could be fine.

499
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:56,160
拜托 如果没事他们不会这样失常
Oh, come on. They wouldn't be freaking out if they were fine.

500
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:57,980
对 因为爸妈从来不会无缘无故地大惊小怪
Right, 'cause mom and dad never freak out over nothing.

501
00:17:58,420 --> 00:18:00,260
他们不会 他们是完美的
They don't. They're perfect.

502
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:03,340
还记不记得爸那次换工作
Remember the time when dad was switching jobs,

503
00:18:03,340 --> 00:18:04,580
妈把我们的垃圾食品全扔了
and mom threw away all of our junk food?

504
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,720
那完全是另一回事
That was completely different.

505
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:07,120
不不 这是一回事
No, no, actually, it's not.

506
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:08,520
他们不知道如何处理自己的事情
They don't know how to deal with their stuff,

507
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:09,580
所以就拿我们开刀
so they obsess over us.

508
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:11,760
也许这次也一样 对吗
Maybe that's all this is, right?

509
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,900
真不敢相信我有多放松
I can't believe how relieved I am.

510
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:16,940
我也是 我在给孩子们发短信
Me, too. I'm just texting the kids.

511
00:18:17,260 --> 00:18:19,240
到了一定年纪 "可能没事"
It's like at a certain age, "It's probably nothing"

512
00:18:19,250 --> 00:18:21,980
就会变成 "可能没事...吧?"
becomes "It's probably nothing."

513
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:23,940
好像他们把"40岁"用斜体标出来了
Like they add italics at 40.

514
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:25,820
好消息是
Well, the good news is...

515
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:29,900
现在的情况让我们越来越亲"近"
These situations just bring us closer and closer together.

516
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:33,740
顺便说一下 你一直表现得很冷静
By the way, you did a great job of keeping your cool.

517
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:35,640
我不想吓坏孩子们
Well, I didn't want to scare the kids.

518
00:18:36,140 --> 00:18:37,620
你的表现也不赖
You did a pretty good job yourself.

519
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:38,320
谢谢
Thanks.

520
00:18:38,813 --> 00:18:40,227
我有个秘密
I have a secret.

521
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:40,960
什么
What's that?

522
00:18:41,460 --> 00:18:43,040
我们是优秀的父母
We're pretty good at this parenting thing.

523
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:44,840
我想是的
I think we are.

524
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:45,740
吻我
Kiss me.

525
00:18:46,651 --> 00:18:47,851
我试试吧
I'm gonna try.

526
00:18:49,126 --> 00:18:50,840
"妈没事"
"Mom ok"?!

527
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:52,660
你们是有史以来最差劲的爹妈
You guys are the worst parents ever.

528
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:54,360
每次都这样
It's the same every time!

529
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:55,820
你们只要有一个遭遇到麻烦问题
One of you guys goes through something stressful,

530
00:18:56,020 --> 00:18:57,900
你们不是积极面对 而是把我们吓得半死
and instead of dealing with it, you freak out on us.

531
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:59,820
辞职吧 别辞职
"Quit your job," "Don't quit your job"?

532
00:18:59,940 --> 00:19:01,280
多看书 少看书
"Read more," "Read less"?

533
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:02,600
能不能做个像样的大人
Be better at being adults!

534
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:04,040
卢克 我们走
Come on, Luke. Let's go!

535
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:06,625
你不再是我妈了 不过没关系
You're not my mom anymore, but okay!

536
00:19:09,220 --> 00:19:12,600
15年后再看看还有没有脸用这种眼光看我们
Save the judgey looks for another 15 years.

537
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:18,540
刚才那是怎么回事
What the hell happened in there?

538
00:19:18,560 --> 00:19:20,720
不知道 我以前从未这样卡住过
I don't know. I've never choked like that before.

539
00:19:21,100 --> 00:19:22,220
你觉得肯定没戏吗
You think it's a definite no?

540
00:19:22,380 --> 00:19:24,000
你可是指着院长儿子的照片
Well, you pointed to a picture of the dean's son

541
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,160
问她的预产期是什么时候
and asked when she's due.

542
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:25,920
没错
Right.

543
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:28,100
抱歉让你失望了 杰
Sorry I let you down, Jay.

544
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:28,560
我
Me?

545
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:30,800
我看出来这对你有多重要
I saw how much it meant to you.

546
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:32,440
就好像我在橄榄球场上
It's like I was on the football field.

547
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:35,701
你在看台上 为我骄傲 为我加油
You were up in the stands, all proud of me, rooting me on.

548
00:19:35,860 --> 00:19:38,400
我不习惯 我失败了
I'm not used to that. I just whiffed.

549
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:40,600
我根本就不适合橄榄球比赛
That's not even the right sport.

550
00:19:41,100 --> 00:19:42,320
我为什么要怪你
Why am I trying to blame you?

551
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:44,074
可能你应该怪我 坐下
Probably 'cause you should be. Sit down.

552
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:48,380
我想我是希望把40年前
I think I put some stuff on you that...

553
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:51,340
有着小鼻子浓密头发的家伙的一切
is about some guys 40 years ago

554
00:19:51,340 --> 00:19:54,220
强加在了你身上
with tiny noses and perfect hair.

555
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:55,860
我没听懂
You're losing me.

556
00:19:56,780 --> 00:19:58,840
我只想让你明白一件事
There's only thing I want you to understand.

557
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:02,080
如果今天是你第一次
If today was the first time

558
00:20:02,279 --> 00:20:03,900
感到我为你骄傲
you've felt that I was proud of you,

559
00:20:03,900 --> 00:20:05,480
那我应该道歉
then I should be apologizing,

560
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:07,871
因为我每天都为你感到骄傲
'cause I'm proud of you every day.

561
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:09,200
谢谢 杰
Thanks, Jay.

562
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,320
走吧
Let's go.

563
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:14,160
我真的跟他打赌
Did I really bet him

564
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,500
我可以把他的手机放进我嘴里吗
I could fit his whole cell phone in my mouth?

565
00:20:15,500 --> 00:20:17,200
别再提他了 你不会再见他了
Forget about that guy. You're never gonna see him again.

566
00:20:17,820 --> 00:20:19,040
这可不好说
I'm not sure about that.

567
00:20:21,140 --> 00:20:21,940
在这里等着
Wait here.

568
00:20:26,146 --> 00:20:27,380
-玉米粒放好了吗 -好了
- Kernels in? - Check.

569
00:20:27,380 --> 00:20:28,560
-只放了右边吗 -是
- On the right side only? - Check.

570
00:20:29,500 --> 00:20:31,320
你知道这是最后的面糊吧
You know this is the last of our batter, right?

571
00:20:31,380 --> 00:20:32,480
我们已经到绝路了
Our backs are against the wall.

572
00:20:35,619 --> 00:20:37,009
你是说"爆薄饼"吧
You mean "Popcake."

573
00:20:37,020 --> 00:20:37,920
我想的是"弹弹饼"
I was thinking "Flipjack."

574
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,976
太棒了
Oh, of course!

575
00:20:38,976 --> 00:20:40,063
好了
It's okay.

576
00:20:40,820 --> 00:20:41,300
好吧
Okay.

577
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:43,140
就是这个了 我有预感
This is the one. I feel it.

578
00:20:43,260 --> 00:20:45,680
如果成功了 几个世纪后
If this works, centuries from now,

579
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:47,160
会有人把这个挖出来
someone's gonna dig one of these things up

580
00:20:47,160 --> 00:20:48,300
纳闷这到底是什么东西
and wonder what the heck it is.

581
00:20:54,620 --> 00:20:55,160
弹
Flip!

582
00:20:56,660 --> 00:20:57,720
弹啊 该死的
Flip, damn you!

583
00:20:58,820 --> 00:21:00,760
-结束了 -没有 -结束了
- It's over. - No, it's not! - It's over!

584
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,360
没事
It's all right.

585
00:21:03,980 --> 00:21:05,460
就这样放在烤盘上吧
We left it all out there on the griddle.

586
00:21:06,501 --> 00:21:07,999
我们伺机再战吧
We live to fight another day.

587
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:09,560
我想是吧
Yeah. I guess.

588
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:11,940
真不敢相信浪费了这么多面糊
I can't believe we wasted all that batter.

589
00:21:12,078 --> 00:21:13,647
不打碎一些鸡蛋
Ah, I guess you can't make an omelet

590
00:21:13,660 --> 00:21:15,220
怎么能做成煎蛋卷呢 对吧
without breaking a few eggs. Am I right?

591
00:21:16,720 --> 00:21:17,820
不行吗
Or can we?

592
00:21:18,220 --> 00:21:19,180
去杂货店
To the grocery store!
